# Button system (header banner tokens)

Match header quick-action chips for all page CTAs.

## Create / primary (“Yeni … Oluştur”, Kaydet primary, BTN_PRIMARY, `btn-primary`)

- Gradient: `from-[#8ad9ff] via-[#60a5fa] to-[#3b82f6]` (CSS vars `--bach-btn-create-*`)
- Height: **52px** (`--ds-control-h: 3.25rem`)
- Radius: `rounded-xl` (12px)
- Shadow: `0 8px 20px -12px rgba(30,35,60,0.55)`
- White bold label

## Cancel / Vazgeç (`btn-cancel`, Button `variant="cancel"|"danger"`)

- Gradient: `from-[#fda4af] via-[#f43f5e] to-[#e11d48]` (same as “Yeni Alış Faturası” chip)
- Same height/radius/shadow as create buttons
- White bold label

## Rules for new UI

- Prefer `btn-primary` / `btn-cancel` or `@bachmain/ui` Button primary/cancel
- Do not invent flat navy primary or gray text-only Vazgeç for page-level CTAs
- Icon-only micro controls may stay smaller; page header and form footer actions use 52px
